# to [[die]]
#: {{syn|es|estirar la pata|fallecer|morirse|palmar|petatearse}}
#: {{ux|es|La caballerosidad no ha '''muerto'''.|Chivalry is not '''dead'''.}}
# {{lb|es|reflexive}} to [[die]]
#: {{ant|es|vivir}}

====Usage notes====
* The [[reflexive]] form of this verb, {{m|es|morirse}}, is more [[colloquial]], while the non-reflexive form, {{m|es|morir}}, is more formal.
* Widely used figuratively, as in English:
** {{uxi|es|'''Me morí''' del aburrimiento|I '''died''' of boredom}}
** {{uxi|es|'''Me morí''' del susto|I '''died''' of [[fright]]}}

